id: DRAFT-reniced-isolated-job-conan-setup-remote
title: 隔离 shadow-CI job 的 CONAN_HOME 未初始化导致 ohpcd remote 缺失，L0i 误报 registry_unreachable
category: draft
status: UNMATCHED
keywords: ohos-prepare-isolated-conan-job, run-conan-heavy.sh, CONAN_HOME, ci/conan/setup.sh, Remote 'ohpcd' doesn't exist, registry_unreachable, L0i, R36, registry probe, conancenter, ohpcd, profile, mktemp, TMPDIR
related: E477, E002, E010
source: reniced 1.23 shadow CI r1 (2026-10-01)
evidence: >
  reniced/1.23 首跑 run-conan-heavy.sh 即 L0 fail: registry_unreachable，
  conan stderr 显示 Remote 'ohpcd' doesn't exist；在 job 的 CONAN_HOME 内执行
  ci/conan/setup.sh（含 mktemp -p 包装规避只读 /tmp）后 remote 补齐，
  r2 起 L0i 识别 perl/5.42.2.3 in registry，r8 全门禁 pass exit 0。
solution_pattern: >
  每个 ohos-prepare-isolated-conan-job.sh 新建的 job，第一次跑 build_and_test.sh
  前先在 job CONAN_HOME 内 source ci/conan/setup.sh（导出 CONAN_HOME/TMPDIR/
  TMPPREFIX 并用 zsh mktemp 包装）；用 conan remote list 验证 ohpcd 存在；
  鉴别：doesn't exist=环境未初始化(本条)；acceleration policy=E477 依赖未发布；
  超时=worker 网络。
